{"title":"2018 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71d74d90f04d0fa1dd2e326d6cf9575e308e790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf12776967ebd36d0fb86432871782942119166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + (x+1) + (x+2) + (x+3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"246\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can plug-in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71d74d90f04d0fa1dd2e326d6cf9575e308e790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> into the expression:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d326e646a96c51a8791d0fd4b16ec5d900d1790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 + (11 + 1) + (11 + 2) + (11 + 3) = 11 + 12 + 13 + 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"441\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a410461255e92d0e520e9d48ea6a64693a853f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=23 + 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaabaa2fbbd117b2123867beba9c1f646ad27671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~originally by Baihly2024 and modified by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018005229\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 32/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1131/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.791      1 2018_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.791      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35933:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018005229 and revision id 279266. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}